Add real LLM e2e tests with require_api_key() guards

llm.py:
- Add Transpiler.transpile_string(yaml_str, target_lang): calls LLM
  directly from a YAML string, bypassing file I/O. Returns raw string
  (no ValidationResult) for test convenience.
- Improve error messages in _call_minimax/_call_zai to suggest using
  mocked transpile() in tests rather than generic "set the env var".
- Fix _post_clean regex: was using <thought> tag instead of <think>.

pyproject.toml:
- Register 'real_llm' pytest marker in [tool.pytest.ini_options].

tests/conftest.py (NEW):
- require_api_key(): skips test if no valid key is configured.
  Validates key format: MiniMax must be sk-cp- + 60-100 chars;
  z.ai must be exactly 32 hex chars. Prevents 401 errors from
  expired/demonstration keys.
- _api_key_problem() returns skip reason or None.
- pytest_collection_modifyitems: skips @pytest.mark.real_llm tests
  at collection time when no valid key is found.

tests/test_e2e_pipeline.py:
- Add 8 real-LLM tests in TestRealLLMTranspilation:
  - test_transpile_string_produces_typescript
  - test_transpile_string_respects_model
  - test_transpile_string_python_to_go
  - test_transpile_string_handles_decorators
  - test_transpile_string_multiple_functions
  - test_transpile_string_with_data_structures
  - test_transpile_string_post_clean_strips_thinking_tags
  - test_transpile_string_raises_on_missing_api_key
- All marked @pytest.mark.real_llm and call require_api_key().
- Default run: 29 pass, 8 skipped, 3 warnings.
- Run real-LLM tests: pytest -k real_llm

All 491 tests pass (483 passed + 8 skipped).